     "titulo": "Reading compound amounts",
     "texto": [
      "On a payslip, **bruttolønn** is the amount before deductions and **utbetaling** the amount paid out. Check the period, the recorded hours and each **trekk**. To ask for clarification without accusing anyone, ask **Kan du forklare hvordan overtiden er beregnet?** («Can you explain how the overtime was calculated?»)."
